\s40 \li2520 \fi-604 \f1 \b0 \fs28 + (void)\b getTIFFCompressionTypes:\b0 (const NSTIFFCompression **)\i list \b \i0 count:\b0 (int *)\i numTypes\i0  \
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns, by reference, an array of NSTIFFCompressions representing all available compression types that can be used when writing a TIFF image. The number of elements in list is represented by \i numTypes\i0 . \i list\i0  belongs to the NSBitmapImageRep class; it shouldn\'27t be freed or altered.\
\fs14\
\fs28 The following compression types are supported:\
\fs14\
\pard \s63 \li1915 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9553 \f0 \b \fs28 Constant\tab Value\tab Usage\
\fs6\
\pard \s61 \li6753 \fi-4838 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9525 \f1 \b0 \fs28 NSTIFFCompressionNone\tab 1\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionCCITTFAX3\tab 3\tab 1 bps images only\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionCCITTFAX4\tab 4\tab 1 bps images only\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionLZW\tab 5\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionJPEG\tab 6\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionNEXT\tab 32766\tab Input only\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionPackBits\tab 32773\
\fs14\
\fs28 NSTIFFCompressionOldJPEG\tab 32865\tab Input only\
\fs14\
\pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 \fs28 Note that not all compression types can be used for all images: NSTIFFCompressionNEXT can be used only to retrieve image data. Because future releases of OpenStep may include other compression types, always use this method to get the available compression types\'d0for example, when you implement a user interface for selecting compression types. \
