\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns an autoreleased string containing the localized name for the compression type represented by \i compression\i0 , or \b nil\b0  if \i compression\i0  is unrecognized. Compression types are listed in the \b getTIFFCompressionTypes:count:\b0  class method description. When implementing a user interface for selecting TIFF compression types, use \b getTIFFCompressionTypes:count:\b0  to get the list of supported compression types, then use this method to get the localized names for each compression type.\
