\i0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns a TIFF representation of the images in array, which are compressed using the specified compression type and factor. Legal values for \i compression\i0  can be found in \b NSBitmapImageRep.h\b0 , and are described in \'aaTiff Compression\'ba in NSBitmapImageRep\'27s class description. \i factor\i0  provides a hint for those compression types that implement variable compression ratios; currently only JPEG compression uses a compression factor. If your compression type doesn\'27t implement variable compression ratios, or if it does and you don\'27t want the image to be compressed, specify a compression factor of 0.0.\
\fs14\
\fs28 If the specified compression isn\'27t applicable, no compression is used. If a problem is encountered during generation of the TIFF, \b TIFFRepresentationOfImageRepsInArray:usingCompression:factor:\b0  raises an NSTIFFException or an NSBadBitmapParametersException.\
